The momentumTransport dictionary is read by any solver that includes turbulence modeling. The keywords defined in this sub-dictionary are the same as the above-described ones.simulationType  RAS;

RAS
{
    model           kEpsilon;
    turbulence      on;
    printCoeffs     on;
